<title>HONG KONG: SocGen-Crosby names global head of sales trading.</title>
<headline>SocGen-Crosby names global head of sales trading.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>SocGen-Crosby said on Tuesday it has appointed Rudy Rolles as global head of sales trading, based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Rolles was previously director of institutional sales and proprietary trading at Fraser Securities, SocGen-Crosby said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
